<title>SINGAPORE: Electronic Resources shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Electronic Resources shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics components distributor Electronic Resources Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday it had requested the Stock Exchange of Singapore to suspend trading of its shares on Thursday pending an announcement.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
